      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753926601701,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. \n\nDesigner \n- have historically been out of the research loop\n- and have had to rely on third-person accounts of user behaviors and desires",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. \n\nDesigner \n- have historically been out of the research loop\n- and have had to rely on third-person accounts of user behaviors and desires",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A31jcQFxQeYVJfWLyR8mq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 454.7935910896463,
      "y": 308.3988313506243,
      "width": 466.30364990234375,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "YWC_JVoOvPzCxSe6zGKS4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 581229147,
      "version": 858,
      "versionNonce": 186892053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "rXfQYPp-gMPYvZJ12Urej",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1753926601701,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. \n\nfew methods capture user behaviors\nin a manner that appropriately directs the definition of a product.\n\nrather than\nprovide information about \n- user goals\n\nmost methods \nprovide information at \n- the TASK[🔗] level",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. \n\nfew methods capture user behaviors\nin a manner that appropriately directs the definition of a product.\n\nrather than\nprovide information about \n- user goals\n\nmost methods \nprovide information at \n- the TASK[🔗] level",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "v3TQ0jt8N8K5OXvRuT38p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1174.6123655848892,
      "y": 530.6009465258538,
      "width": 387.74371337890625,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 582218997,
      "version": 1559,
      "versionNonce": 1326562293,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "rXfQYPp-gMPYvZJ12Urej",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1753926595310,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TASK[🔗] level information\n\nIS USEFUL for \n- defining layout, \n- workflow, \n- and translation of functions into interface controls.\n\n\n\nLESS USEFUL \nfor defining the basic framework of\n- what a product is\n- what it does\n- and how it should meet the broad needs of the user.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TASK[🔗] level information\n\nIS USEFUL for \n- defining layout, \n- workflow, \n- and translation of functions into interface controls.\n\n\n\nLESS USEFUL \nfor defining the basic framework of\n- what a product is\n- what it does\n- and how it should meet the broad needs of the user.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
